{"page":20025,"part":1,"text":"记白云先生书诀\n\n\n言讫，真隐子遂镌石以为陈迹。维永和九年三月六日右将军王羲之记。\n\n天台紫真谓予曰“子虽至矣,而未善也。书之气,必达乎道,同混元之理。七宝齐贵,万古能名。阳气明则华壁立,阴气太则风神生。把笔抵锋,肇乎本性。刀圆则润,势疾则涩；紧则劲,险则峻；内贵盈,外贵虚；起不孤,伏不寡；回仰非近,背接非远；望之惟逸,发之惟静。敬兹法也,书妙尽矣。”言讫,真隐子遂镌石以为陈迹。维永和九年三月六日右将军王羲之记。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20025,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"7bc01bafa490d93d4bb220e597cb684caa89634a3c65c506260faf05a90af016","textSha256":"7bc01bafa490d93d4bb220e597cb684caa89634a3c65c506260faf05a90af016","fileSha256":"7bc01bafa490d93d4bb220e597cb684caa89634a3c65c506260faf05a90af016","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20025-work-023.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"记白云先生书诀 · 记白云先生书诀","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/ta1B6HMir3xdd3NZxaUHtk","originalPages":[49,50],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":8,"sourceTextSha256":"6b912b970d65dbf7b6e58cce3a45a64a2e7045aea14485f67d8f5affcdde9382","id":"local-49-429-443","page_id":49,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":429,"rawEnd":443,"reviewedTextSha256":"51077515d2610544be3f5fb6ba5140c35235854a812228941f9a4056b4260d5c","displayUnitOrigins":[[435,436],[436,437],[437,438],[438,439],[439,440],[440,441],[441,442],[442,443]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":49,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T08:00:48.441Z","revision":"51077515d2610544be3f5fb6ba5140c35235854a812228941f9a4056b4260d5c","textSha256":"51077515d2610544be3f5fb6ba5140c35235854a812228941f9a4056b4260d5c","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update